details.returned_prompt:
{
  "high_level_description": "Shot on iPhone, a quiet tree-lined residential street in a small Brazilian town on an overcast late morning, with a small two-storey whitewashed clinic anchored centre-left, a wooden pergolado casting striped shadows, and the sidewalk receding to the right past mature jacaranda and ipê trees.",
  "compositional_deconstruction": {
    "background": "An overcast late-morning sky in soft neutral cool grey, diffusing even light across the scene with no harsh shadows. The asphalt of a narrow residential street runs along the right side of the frame, receding into the distance. Mature jacaranda and ipê trees line the sidewalk in front of the clinic, their canopies breaking into the upper corners of the frame and casting dappled shade across the white facade and the asphalt. A single parked motorcycle sits deep in the background down the quiet street, small in scale. Fine grain across the entire frame. Deep depth of field with everything in focus from foreground to background.",
    "elements": [
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Small two-storey clinic building, the primary architectural subject, anchored centre-left of the frame. Whitewashed stucco walls in clean true white, simple rectangular form, flat roofline with a low parapet. Wooden pergolado in weathered honey-toned timber projects over the ground-floor facade, casting soft striped shadows on the white wall beneath. Glass entrance door at street level framed in slim dark metal, slightly recessed behind a short tiled landing. Pale grey-painted wood signboard mounted above the door, blank with no lettering. Concrete ramp with a thin stainless handrail runs up the left side of the entrance alongside four shallow tiled steps."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Black powder-coated bicycle rack bolted to the pavement to the right of the steps, midground. Holds one old red city bicycle leaning against it, classic upright frame with a leather saddle and curved handlebars."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Adjacent low residential house partially visible at the right edge of the frame, midground. Terracotta-tiled pitched roof and a closed green wooden gate at street level."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Narrow paved sidewalk in pale grey interlocking tiles running along the building front, anchoring the lower third of the frame and receding toward the right."
      }
    ]
  }
}
